{"id":"227c7eaf354f0ec0","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-turing-degree.md","title":"Turing Degree","display":"df-turing-degree — Turing Degree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-turing-degree","aliases":["58-df-turing-degree","58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-degree","58-df-zfc-recursion3-turing-degree"],"display":"df-turing-degree — Turing Degree","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-turing-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-turing-degree</span><span>58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-degree</span><span>58-df-zfc-recursion3-turing-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-degree — Turing Degree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7f65c348d236e554\" href=\"?note=7f65c348d236e554\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md\">../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1d725a0797bae6df\" href=\"?note=1d725a0797bae6df\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md\">58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,A&#39;,B,B&#39;\\subseteq\\omega\\land d\\in V\\land e\\in\\omega\">\\(A,A&#39;,B,B&#39;\\subseteq\\omega\\land d\\in V\\land e\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)^2\">\\(\\leq_T\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f65c348d236e554\" href=\"?note=7f65c348d236e554\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md\">../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1d725a0797bae6df\" href=\"?note=1d725a0797bae6df\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md\">58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)^2\">\\(\\equiv_T\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)^2\\)</span> (Turing equivalence defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]_T\\in V\\land\\mathcal D_T\\in V\">\\([A]_T\\in V\\land\\mathcal D_T\\in V\\)</span> (degree and degree structure defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus_T:\\mathcal P(\\omega)^2\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\land\\vee_T:\\mathcal D_T^2\\to\\mathcal D_T\">\\(\\oplus_T:\\mathcal P(\\omega)^2\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\land\\vee_T:\\mathcal D_T^2\\to\\mathcal D_T\\)</span> (join operators defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringDegree}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TuringDegree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringDegree}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TuringDegree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (aliases defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash A\\equiv_TB\\leftrightarrow A\\leq_TB\\land B\\leq_TA\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash A\\equiv_TB\\leftrightarrow A\\leq_TB\\land B\\leq_TA\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}class} \\vdash [A]_T\\coloneqq\\{B\\subseteq\\omega:A\\equiv_TB\\}\\land\\mathcal D_T\\coloneqq\\{[A]_T:A\\subseteq\\omega\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}class} \\vdash [A]_T\\coloneqq\\{B\\subseteq\\omega:A\\equiv_TB\\}\\land\\mathcal D_T\\coloneqq\\{[A]_T:A\\subseteq\\omega\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}zero} \\vdash \\mathbf0\\coloneqq[\\varnothing]_T\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}zero} \\vdash \\mathbf0\\coloneqq[\\varnothing]_T\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}halting} \\vdash K\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\omega:\\exists y\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,\\varnothing,e)\\}\\land\\mathbf0&#39;\\coloneqq[K]_T\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}halting} \\vdash K\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\omega:\\exists y\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,\\varnothing,e)\\}\\land\\mathbf0&#39;\\coloneqq[K]_T\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}representative\\text{-}join} \\vdash A\\oplus_TB\\coloneqq\\{2n:n\\in A\\}\\cup\\{2n+1:n\\in B\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}representative\\text{-}join} \\vdash A\\oplus_TB\\coloneqq\\{2n:n\\in A\\}\\cup\\{2n+1:n\\in B\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}join\\text{-}well\\text{-}defined} \\vdash A\\equiv_TA&#39;\\land B\\equiv_TB&#39;\\to A\\oplus_TB\\equiv_TA&#39;\\oplus_TB&#39;\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}join\\text{-}well\\text{-}defined} \\vdash A\\equiv_TA&#39;\\land B\\equiv_TB&#39;\\to A\\oplus_TB\\equiv_TA&#39;\\oplus_TB&#39;\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}degree\\text{-}join} \\vdash [A]_T\\vee_T[B]_T\\coloneqq[A\\oplus_TB]_T\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}degree\\text{-}join} \\vdash [A]_T\\vee_T[B]_T\\coloneqq[A\\oplus_TB]_T\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}alias2} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringDegree}_S(d,A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land d=[A]_T\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}alias2} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringDegree}_S(d,A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land d=[A]_T\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}alias3} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TuringDegree}_S(A,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringDegree}_S(d,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}alias3} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TuringDegree}_S(A,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringDegree}_S(d,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Turing度是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\">\\(\\leq_T\\)</span>下的等价类</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-degree</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-recursion3-turing-degree</code> are merged here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_T\">\\(\\mathcal D_T\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vee_T\">\\(\\vee_T\\)</span> 下形成上半格。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{0}\">\\(\\mathbf{0}\\)</span> 是可计算集的度</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{0}&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf{0}&#39;\\)</span> 是 halting problem 的度</li>\n<li>存在不可比较的度（由 Spector 证明）</li>\n<li>The halting set now uses the registered oracle-computation graph with empty oracle; the undefined metavariable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e(e)\\downarrow\">\\(\\Phi_e(e)\\downarrow\\)</span> has been removed from the object-level assertion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md","status":"resolved","id":"7f65c348d236e554","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d725a0797bae6df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md","status":"resolved","id